# Pre-push gate (NIE-GOV-009, NIE-TEST-001).
#
# pre-commit stays fast: format + lint + build only. Tests run here instead, so
# a developer cannot outrun the suite locally, while still getting quick commits.
#
# PostgreSQL- and RabbitMQ-backed tests skip when NIE_TEST_POSTGRES_ADMIN_CONNECTION
# and NIE_TEST_RABBITMQ_CONNECTION are unset, so this hook works on a laptop with
# no services running. CI sets both, so nothing is skipped there.
# To run the full suite locally, start the services and export both variables.

pnpm --dir src/frontend -r test
dotnet test --solution src/backend/Backend.sln -c Release
